    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST THE FULL GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>\u0421heck out other games</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This version allows you to experience the beginning of the game and get a taste of the thrilling gameplay. Prepare to experience the trial from Ajax, featuring 7 levels and a boss fight in Legendary Hoplite: Ajax's Trial the prologue version of the game<br><br><strong>Face 7 Levels and a Boss Battle</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/c9727047ce5adcb199e06861f31196e6.poster.avif?t=1743024286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/c9727047ce5adcb199e06861f31196e6.webm?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/c9727047ce5adcb199e06861f31196e6.mp4?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Face the challenge of 7 distinct levels, each filled with hordes of mythic monsters. Test your skills against a boss at the end of your journey.<br><br><strong>Customize Your Build</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/936471ec357a9a48a218a2eb5eeae575.poster.avif?t=1743024286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/936471ec357a9a48a218a2eb5eeae575.webm?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/936471ec357a9a48a218a2eb5eeae575.mp4?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Create your own build by experimenting with different gear combinations that you find along the way. Discover the perfect fit for your playstyle.<br><br><strong>Power Up Your Army</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/4bb59fbc28f18cd2ef043b4427e9695c.poster.avif?t=1743024286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/4bb59fbc28f18cd2ef043b4427e9695c.webm?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/4bb59fbc28f18cd2ef043b4427e9695c.mp4?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Upgrade your army and combine them with the Hero to become even more powerful and confront the enemy.<br><br><strong>Mini But Mighty</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/e942c23fbfbf7df3dd95957714fb39c8.poster.avif?t=1743024286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/e942c23fbfbf7df3dd95957714fb39c8.webm?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/e942c23fbfbf7df3dd95957714fb39c8.mp4?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take a break from the main game and play a thrilling minigame that's included in the prologue version.",
    "about_the_game": "This version allows you to experience the beginning of the game and get a taste of the thrilling gameplay. Prepare to experience the trial from Ajax, featuring 7 levels and a boss fight in Legendary Hoplite: Ajax's Trial the prologue version of the game<br><br><strong>Face 7 Levels and a Boss Battle</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/c9727047ce5adcb199e06861f31196e6.poster.avif?t=1743024286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/c9727047ce5adcb199e06861f31196e6.webm?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/c9727047ce5adcb199e06861f31196e6.mp4?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Face the challenge of 7 distinct levels, each filled with hordes of mythic monsters. Test your skills against a boss at the end of your journey.<br><br><strong>Customize Your Build</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/936471ec357a9a48a218a2eb5eeae575.poster.avif?t=1743024286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/936471ec357a9a48a218a2eb5eeae575.webm?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/936471ec357a9a48a218a2eb5eeae575.mp4?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Create your own build by experimenting with different gear combinations that you find along the way. Discover the perfect fit for your playstyle.<br><br><strong>Power Up Your Army</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/4bb59fbc28f18cd2ef043b4427e9695c.poster.avif?t=1743024286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/4bb59fbc28f18cd2ef043b4427e9695c.webm?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/4bb59fbc28f18cd2ef043b4427e9695c.mp4?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Upgrade your army and combine them with the Hero to become even more powerful and confront the enemy.<br><br><strong>Mini But Mighty</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/e942c23fbfbf7df3dd95957714fb39c8.poster.avif?t=1743024286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/e942c23fbfbf7df3dd95957714fb39c8.webm?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422080/extras/e942c23fbfbf7df3dd95957714fb39c8.mp4?t=1743024286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take a break from the main game and play a thrilling minigame that's included in the prologue version.",
    "short_description": "Legendary Hoplite: Ajax's Trial is the prologue version of Legendary Hoplite, a game that combines Tower Defense and Action RPG genres. In this game, you'll need to build fortifications, upgrade your army, and create your own unique strategy to fight off hordes of monsters across 7 levels.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Vietnamese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cLegendary Hoplite seems to have translated its theme in a simple but satisfying way, directly lifting imagery and creatures from Greek mythology and film adaptations. In fact, gameplay is centered on defending a gate in a choke point, so it really does call 300 to mind too.\u201d<br>TryHardGuides, Anthony Fertino<br><br>\u201cEverything I\u2019ve seen so far points to an engaging gameplay loop of taking on increasingly strong opponents, gaining more abilities to help defend against them, and getting powerful loot from each battle.\u201d<br>The Indie Informer, Jill Grodt<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s a fun game where strategic arrangement of your units is key, especially when facing powerful bosses, such as Cerberus, Minotaurs and Hydra\u201d<br>AlphaBetaGamer, KJ Robertson<br>",
